#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:3
#: 8592a585b76642cdb955c4aa08b1e5d1
msgid ""
"Marvin SDK hardware interface plugin (M6 and related). Command interfaces"
" are joint **`position` only**. Compliance is vendor `ctrl_mode` "
"(`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / `POWER_OFF`) plus "
"`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`. USB-dongle 夹爪 / 灵巧手 use "
"[Modbus](7-modbus.md) or [CAN](8-can.md), not this package."
msgstr ""
"Marvin SDK 驱动层插件（M6 及同系）。命令接口仅为关节 **`position`**。柔顺是厂商 "
"`ctrl_mode`（`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`）加上 `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`。USB 转接头夹爪 / 灵巧手走 "
"[Modbus](7-modbus.md) 或 [CAN](8-can.md)，不是本包。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:5
#: 0e799cd72fe54e8389237f8b46296f97
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control) · [README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control) · [README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:7
#: b67b700bca6f45ffb84f3cb9592496ae
msgid ""
"**Plugin:** `marvin_ros2_control/MarvinHardware`. URDF `<param>` are "
"declared as node parameters. README §4 lists the Runtime set; "
"`paramCallback` matches those plus `drag_mode`, `cart_type`, "
"`*_kine_param` / `*_dyn_param`, `tool_debug_log`."
msgstr ""
"**插件：** `marvin_ros2_control/MarvinHardware`。URDF `<param>` "
"声明为节点参数。README §4 列出运行时集合；`paramCallback` 对应这些，外加 "
"`drag_mode`、`cart_type`、`*_kine_param` / `*_dyn_param`、`tool_debug_log`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:9
#: 2f0b0e1168634517b0cb2e33248c7f9a
msgid ""
"Tianji control SDK (`TJ_FX_ROBOT_CONTRL_SDK`, private submodule) is a "
"pre-built library linked when this hardware interface compiles; it is not"
" redistributed separately."
msgstr "天玑控制 SDK（`TJ_FX_ROBOT_CONTRL_SDK`，私有子模块）是预编译库，在本驱动层编译时链接；不单独再分发。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:11
#: 0e2eb47f4598423593de83e64a9f3cd9
msgid ""
"`left_ee_channel` / `right_ee_channel`: `1` = CAN/CAN FD, `2` = COM1 "
"RS485 (source `COM1_CHANNEL`)."
msgstr ""
"`left_ee_channel` / `right_ee_channel`：`1` = CAN/CAN FD，`2` = COM1 "
"RS485（源码 `COM1_CHANNEL`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/6-marvin.md:13
#: c22ee6b15a87439d9d74925ac6da2bab
msgid ""
"Tool-dynamics / 负载辨识 wizard: `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control "
"tool_dyn_identify_wizard`. VR path: [VR "
"Teleoperation](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"工具动力学 / 负载辨识向导：`ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`。VR"
" 路径：[VR 遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

